ying the stated phase durations (Discovery 3, Build 6, QA 4, Release 1 business day, each phase starting the next business day after the prior one ends) from the 2026-10-05 start, and excluding weekends and the 2026-10-12 company holiday, yields a launch date of 2026-10-23 — one business day after the delivery packet's stated 2026-10-22. The packet's date appears not to account for the holiday falling inside the Build phase. This brief uses the recomputed 2026-10-23.\n\nSecurity's resolution rate (76/80 = 95.0%) matched the packet's own summary and required no correction.\n\nAll three discrepancies should be escalated to the respective functional owners (Finance, Support, Delivery/PM) to confirm which source is authoritative before these numbers are used in external reporting.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2918,"cache_read_input_tokens":36144,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2918},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"77470a38-6f60-4d0c-ae37-edaf080c25c3","uuid":"fa9e8169-a51a-4430-9721-8be032bdddcf","timestamp":"2026-08-22T06:43:06.549Z","request_id":"req_011CeHLFfteGksrTZG8DSpdE"}
